We pioneer technology for mobility experience that matter to people.

Your Mission, Roles And Responsibilities

As a Quality Trainee, you will have the opportunity to gain hands-on experience in the automotive industry. You will work closely with the Quality team and be involved in key processes that ensure product compliance and continuous improvement. Your main responsibilities will include:

